SUMMARY:Representations and Harmonic Maps into Spheres
DESCRIPTION:I will discuss some recent progress on harmonic maps from surfa
 ces to spheres which are energy minimizing representatives of orthogonal r
 epresentations. What can be said about their shapes and their limit geomet
 ry as the dimension of the representations grows to infinity? This is part
 ly joint with Riccardo Caniato and Xingzhe Li.\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.f
 r/event/17586/
